title: Guangxi Province
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: guangxi_governor = Li Zongren;
on-arrival: guangxi_affairs_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/LiZongren.jpg
#subtitle: Guangxi is our twin province in the south.

= Guangxi Affairs

Guangxi is our twin province along with Guangdong, making up "Liangguang". Li Zongren, it's ruling warlord is affiliated with the KMT and is part of the NRA.

We can enact policies in Guangxi with Zongren's help.

- @nrabuildup: Raise more troops from Guangxi
- @nraquality: Train the Guangxi NRA 7th Army.
- @build_gxc: Build relations with Li Zongren's clique.
- @vs_cpc: Stamp out any Communists in Guangxi.
- @root: No new policies are needed.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@nrabuildup
title: Build up the National Revolutionary Army
subtitle: -1 resources - Increase our propaganda measures to recruit more members into the NRA.
choose-if: resources >= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; nra_strength += 30

We have recruited more members into the NRA.

@nraquality
title: Training the 7th Army
subtitle: -1 - Better training and arms will ensure a more quality force.
choose-if: resources >= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: nra_militancy += 0.05; gxc_relations += 5;

Li Zongren's 7th Army has been better trained. Li Zongren approves.

@build_gxc
title: Cooperate with Li Zongren and his New Guangxi Clique.
subtitle: This may make the KMT more reliant on warlords.
on-arrival: gxc_relations += 10; warlordist += 5; pro_republic -= 5;

We have built relations with the New Guangxi Clique.

@vs_cpc
title: Crack down on any Communists in Guangxi.
subtitle: Li Zongren will help out with this.
view-if: cpc_civil_war = 1
on-arrival: red_strength -2;

The CPC elements in Guangxi have been suppressed.
